Subject: [PATCH] Keep incomplete RHI resource initialization retriable

QRhiWidget must finish its target initialization before invoking render, also
after partial creation or resize failures. Failed framebuffer grabs return an
empty image. Discard failed compositor resources and balance aborted frames
without presenting incomplete contents, retaining valid queued uploads.

